oject-artifact-association-without-process-ownership\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Story 1: Project Artifact Association Without Process Ownership\\\"},\\\"passesRequested\\\":3,\\\"passesCompleted\\\":3,\\\"passArtifacts\\\":[{\\\"passNumber\\\":1,\\\"path\\\":\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build-wt-1/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/01-project-artifact-association-without-process-ownership/002-self-review-pass-1.json\\\"},{\\\"passNumber\\\":2,\\\"path\\\":\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build-wt-1/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/01-project-artifact-association-without-process-ownership/003-self-review-pass-2.json\\\"},{\\\"passNumber\\\":3,\\\"path\\\":\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build-wt-1/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/01-project-artifact-association-without-process-ownership/004-self-review-pass-3.json\\\"}],\\\"planSummary\\\":\\\"Implemented the Story 1 read-model alignment so project-shell artifact summaries stay project-scoped, process materials derive artifact meaning from current refs plus revision provenance instead of ownership hints, and referenced artifacts remain reviewable without regressing existing produced-artifact or package review behavior. Self-review passes confirmed the in-scope story, tech-design, and test-plan obligations are implemented and evidenced, with remaining deferred cleanup explicitly surfaced below.\\\",\\\"changedFiles\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\"apps/platform/server/services/processes/readers/materials-section.reader.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Derives current-material artifact role labels from version provenance so process-local visibility no longer depends on legacy artifact ownership hints.\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Builds review target availability from current refs plus existing produced-artif