o-narrow current-ref-only reviewability rule, then re-ran both story and epic gates successfully.\\\"],\\\"findingsSurfaced\\\":[\\\"Legacy artifact-row ownership hints still exist in some internal durable/test seams as compatibility residue; this story stops relying on them in the affected read paths, but Story 2 remains the write-path cleanup point.\\\",\\\"Review eligibility now intentionally unions current refs with produced-artifact visibility to preserve existing shipped behavior during this chunk; a later epic/story can narrow or replace that compatibility path once package-context and full review-context alignment land.\\\"]},\\\"openQuestions\\\":[],\\\"specDeviations\\\":[],\\\"recommendedNextStep\\\":\\\"Proceed to verification with focused checks on cross-process artifact reference behavior in the project shell, process materials, and review entry paths, then carry the deferred write-path and compatibility cleanup into Story 2 and later review-context alignment work.\\\"},\\\"errors\\\":[],\\\"warnings\\\":[],\\\"artifacts\\\":[{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"self-review-pass\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build-wt-1/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/01-project-artifact-association-without-process-ownership/002-self-review-pass-1.json\\\"},{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"self-review-pass\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build-wt-1/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/01-project-artifact-association-without-process-ownership/003-self-review-pass-2.json\\\"},{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"self-review-pass\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build-wt-1/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/01-project-artifact-association-without-process-ownership/004-self-review-pass-3.json\\\"},{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"result-envelope\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build-wt-1/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--a